  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHF Somalia Humanitarian Fund 2020 -</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main objective: Support life-saving and life-sustaining assistance to the most vulnerable groups, based on the most urgent humanitarian needs as defined in the HRP or in response to sudden onset emergency needs. Further, SHF focuses on famine prevention, ensuring the centrality of protection in all interventions and the support for local partners by striving to channel at least 40% of funding through local partners.</narrative>
  </description>
